    LLM: 'Game: Panjpar. 2 players, 52 cards. 5 each, turn-up trump. Attack: 1/3/5 (3=pair+1, 5=two pairs+1). Beat with higher same suit or trump. Pick up = attacker attacks again. Draw to 5. Cannot attack with more than defender holds. First out wins.',
    Player: 'Welcome to Panjpar. Guess trump colour; correct guesser attacks first. Attack with 1, 3, or 5 cards. Defender beats or picks up. Draw to 5. First to empty hand wins.',
